{
  "date": "2026-11-04",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "央行进行第三次互换便利操作，规模1000亿元",
  "title_en": "The central bank carries out its third swap facility operation, worth 100 billion yuan",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月2日，中国人民银行宣布，将进行第三次“证券、基金、保险公司互换便利”操作。这次操作的规模是1000亿元，期限是一年，到期后可以延长。",
      "en": "On November 2, the People's Bank of China announced it would carry out its third \"Securities, Fund and Insurance Company Swap Facility\" operation. This operation is worth 100 billion yuan, has a term of one year, and can be extended when it matures."
    },
    {
      "zh": "一共有31家证券和基金公司提出申请，申请的金额比前两次都多。",
      "en": "In total, 31 securities and fund companies applied, and the amount applied for was larger than in either of the previous two rounds."
    },
    {
      "zh": "国泰海通、招商证券、国金证券、国联民生证券和东吴证券中标，费率是10个基点。国泰海通表示，前两次拿到的资金已经全部用来买A股和股票ETF。",
      "en": "Guotai Haitong, China Merchants Securities, Guojin Securities, Guolian Minsheng Securities and Soochow Securities won bids, at a rate of 10 basis points. Guotai Haitong said the funds it got in the first two rounds have all been used to buy A-shares and stock ETFs."
    },
    {
      "zh": "互换便利是央行的一种工具。符合条件的公司可以用手里的债券和股票ETF，向央行换国债等容易变现的资产，再用这些资金买股票。第一次和第二次分别在2024年10月和2025年1月进行，规模是500亿元和550亿元。",
      "en": "The swap facility is a tool of the central bank. Qualifying companies can use the bonds and stock ETFs they hold to exchange for government bonds and other assets that are easy to turn into cash, and then use those funds to buy stocks. The first and second rounds took place in October 2024 and January 2025, worth 50 billion and 55 billion yuan respectively."
    }
  ],
